{"speciesId":463,"names":{"fr":"Coudlangue","es":"Lickilicky","en":"Lickilicky","ja":"ベロベルト"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It wraps things with its extensible tongue. Getting too close to it will leave you soaked with drool."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It wraps things with its extensible tongue. Getting too close to it will leave you soaked with drool."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The long tongue is always soggy with slobber. The saliva contains a solvent that causes numbness."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its saliva can decompose anything. It wraps its long tongue around things to coat them with its sticky saliva."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It has space in its throat to store saliva. It can also roll up its tongue and store it in the same spot."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Sa longue langue est couverte en permanence d’une épaisse couche de bave anesthésiante."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The long tongue is always soggy with slobber. The saliva contains a solvent that causes numbness."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Sa longue langue est couverte en permanence d’une épaisse couche de bave anesthésiante."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The long tongue is always soggy with slobber. The saliva contains a solvent that causes numbness."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Their saliva contains lots of components that can dissolve anything. The numbness caused by their lick does not dissipate."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Their saliva contains lots of components that can dissolve anything. The numbness caused by their lick does not dissipate."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il enroule tout dans sa langue extensible. Ceux qui l’approchent finissent couverts de bave."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Agarra cosas con su lengua extensible. Si te acercas mucho, te deja lleno de babas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It wraps things with its extensible tongue. Getting too close to it will leave you soaked with drool."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ぐんぐん 伸びる ベロを なんにでも 巻きつける。うかつに 近寄ると だえきで べとべとに されてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa bave anesthésiante est chargée d’une substance capable de faire fondre n’importe quelle matière."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"La alta concentración de sustancias en su saliva lo disuelve todo. Un lametón provoca un entumecimiento permanente."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Their saliva contains lots of components that can dissolve anything. The numbness caused by their lick does not dissipate."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"だえきには どんな 物も 溶かす 成分が たっぷり 含まれており なめられると いつまでも しびれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il enroule tout dans sa langue extensible. Ceux qui l’approchent finissent couverts de bave."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Agarra cosas con su lengua extensible. Si te acercas mucho, te deja lleno de babas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It wraps things with its extensible tongue. Getting too close to it will leave you soaked with drool."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"ぐんぐん 伸びる ベロを なんにでも 巻きつける。うかつに 近寄ると だえきで べとべとに されてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sa bave anesthésiante est chargée d’une substance capable de faire fondre n’importe quelle matière."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La alta concentración de sustancias en su saliva lo disuelve todo. Un lametón provoca un entumecimiento permanente."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Their saliva contains lots of components that can dissolve anything. The numbness caused by their lick does not dissipate."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"だえきには どんな 物も 溶かす 成分が たっぷり 含まれており なめられると いつまでも しびれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il existe un concours visant à déterminer lequel d’entre eux a la langue la plus longue. Le record actuel est de 25 m."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se celebra una competición para comprobar qué Lickilicky logra extender más lejos la lengua. El récord actual es de 25 metros."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"A contest is under way to determine which one can stick its tongue out the farthest. The current record is...more than 82 feet."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"舌が どこまで 伸びるのかの コンテストが 開催 されている。 現在の 最高記録は２５ｍ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il est bien plus adroit avec sa langue qu’avec ses autres membres, au point qu’elle peut même lui servir à ramasser un grain de riz minuscule."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Es mucho más hábil usando la lengua que sus extremidades, hasta el punto de poder coger con gran maña una minúscula habichuela."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It uses its tongue much more skillfully than its hands or its feet. It can deftly pick up a single small bean with its tongue."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"手足 より ベロを 使うほうが ずっと 得意。 小さな マメの １粒だけを 器用に 摘める。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Sa langue a l’incroyable faculté de s’allonger et d’atteindre plusieurs fois la taille de son corps. Ce mystère de la nature reste entier."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su lengua es un misterio sin resolver: no se sabe cómo puede extenderla hasta alcanzar longitudes que superan varias veces la de su propio cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Lickilicky’s strange tongue can stretch to many times the length of its body. No one has figured out how Lickilicky’s tongue can stretch so far."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"体の 何倍もの 長さまで 伸びる 不思議な ベロを もつ。 その 不思議は 未解明のまま。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il est aussi habile avec sa langue que les êtres humains le sont avec leurs mains. En revanche, il est maladroit quand il utilise ses doigts."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Es tan diestro con la lengua como un ser humano con las manos. Por el contrario, muestra escasa maña con los dedos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Lickilicky can do just about anything with its tongue, which is as dexterous as the human hand. In contrast, Lickilicky’s use of its fingers is clumsy."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"人間の 手先にも 負けないほど 器用な ベロで なんでも できる。 反対に 指先は 不器用だ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Its tongue can extend and contract freely, and it is capable of reaching lengths over 10 times Lickilicky's height. Beware of the saliva, as it contains corrosive elements."}],"varieties":[{"id":463,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bind","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[8,"level-up",29],[9,"level-up",29],[10,"level-up",29],[11,"level-up",29],[14,"level-up",29],[15,"level-up",29],[16,"level-up",29],[17,"level-up",29],[18,"level-up",29],[20,"level-up",48],[23,"level-up",48]]},{"name":"stomp","learns":[[8,"level-up",21],[9,"level-up",21],[10,"level-up",21],[11,"level-up",21],[14,"level-up",21]